  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Drain, rinse and set aside.\n• Meanwhile, roughly chop Asian greens. Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3441d062b385ef87c077c-2b3389b5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.\n• Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3441d062b385ef87c077c-879d88aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook trimmed green beans, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and Asian greens and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in Asian stir fry sauce, soy sauce mix and the water and simmer, until heated through, 30 seconds - 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat and add cooked noodles, tofu and baby spinach leaves, tossing to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3441d062b385ef87c077c-e8514992.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Asian tofu and mixed veggie egg noodle stir-fry between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over crispy shallots. Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3441d062b385ef87c077c-42496296.jpeg"
    }
  ]
